nputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":34},{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":35},{"localized_name":"fps","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"fps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"bit_depth","name":"bit_depth","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"bit_depth"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VIDEO","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","slot_index":0,"links":[36]}],"title":"CreateVideo","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"CreateVideo"},"widgets_values":[24,8],"widgets_values_named":{"fps":24,"bit_depth":8}},{"id":991,"type":"SaveVideo","pos":[3360,1057],"size":[280,254.15384615384616],"flags":{},"order":34,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":36},{"localized_name":"filename_prefix","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"format","name":"format","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"format"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"codec","name":"codec","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"codec"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","slot_index":0,"links":[]}],"title":"SaveVideo","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"SaveVideo"},"widgets_values":["video/x","auto","auto"],"widgets_values_named":{"filename_prefix":"video/x","format":"auto","codec":"auto"}},{"id":90000,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,64],"size":[470,240],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"1. モデル","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 1. モデル\n\n`UNETLoader` → `MiniMaxH3SigmaShift` → `PathchSageAttentionKJ` の順。\n\n**SigmaShift は 12 / 3 のまま**。H3 の学習時の値です。\n\n蒸留 LoRA（PDD / turbo）は入れていません。部分書き換えでは\n素のモデルの方が文字と細部が正確でした。8 step でも 39 フレームなら\n**約 150 秒**で終わります。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 1. モデル\n\n`UNETLoader` → `MiniMaxH3SigmaShift` → `PathchSageAttentionKJ` の順。\n\n**SigmaShift は 12 / 3 のまま**。H3 の学習時の値です。\n\n蒸留 LoRA（PDD / turbo）は入れていません。部分書き換えでは\n素のモデルの方が文字と細部が正確でした。8 step でも 39 フレームなら\n**約 150 秒**で終わります。"},"color":"#3f5159","bgcolor":"#3f5159"},{"id":90001,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[560,64],"size":[470,375],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"2. 参照","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 2. 参照\n\n**`LoadImage`** — 見た目の基準になる 1 枚。\n\n**`MiniMaxH3ReferenceVideoPrepare`** — 参照動画。ここが延長版の要点です。\n\n`MiniMaxH3ReferenceVideoPrepare` は素材が `length` 分のフレームを\n持つことを要求します。**元クリップから切り出したものでは足りません。**\n完成動画から**延長後の長さ分**を切り出して用意してください。\n\n```\n元クリップ  246-284  (39 フレーム)\n参照動画    246-321  (75 フレーム)  ← 73 要求に 2 枚の余裕\n```\n\n`length` は延長ノードから取るので、ここも自動で追いかけます。\n\n参照動画には**音声トラックが必須**です。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 2. 参照\n\n**`LoadImage`** — 見た目の基準になる 1 枚。\n\n**`MiniMaxH3ReferenceVideoPrepare`** — 参照動画。ここが延長版の要点です。\n\n`MiniMaxH3ReferenceVideoPrepare` は素材が `length` 分のフレームを\n持つことを要求します。**元クリップから切り出したものでは足りません。**\n完成動画から**延長後の長さ分**を切り出して用意してください。\n\n```\n元クリップ  246-284  (39 フレーム)\n参照動画    246-321  (75 フレーム)  ← 73 要求に 2 枚の余裕\n```\n\n`length` は延長ノードから取るので、ここも自動で追いかけます。\n\n参照動画には**音声トラックが必須**です。"},"color":"#4a5f3f","bgcolor":"#4a5f3f"},{"id":90002,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1120,64],"size":[470,270],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"3. 条件付け","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 3. 条件付け\n\n`MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` が参照画像・参照動画・プロンプトを\nひとつの条件にまとめます。Contex Loop のスケジュール参照は使いません。\n\nプロンプトの要点は 2 つです。\n\n- 参照画像を **fully_preserved as APPEARANCE**（髪と服はここから取る）\n- 参照動画を **fully_preserved as MOTION AND STAGING ONLY, never as appearance**\n\nこの区別を書かないと、参照動画の中の元の姿に引き戻されます。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 3. 条件付け\n\n`MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` が参照画像・参照動画・プロンプトを\nひとつの条件にまとめます。Contex Loop のスケジュール参照は使いません。\n\nプロンプトの要点は 2 つです。\n\n- 参照画像を **fully_preserved as APPEARANCE**（髪と服はここから取る）\n- 参照動画を **fully_preserved as MOTION AND STAGING ONLY, never as appearance**\n\nこの区別を書かないと、参照動画の中の元の姿に引き戻されます。"},"color":"#5a4a63","bgcolor":"#5a4a63"},{"id":90004,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2240,64],"size":[470,435],"flags":{},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"5. マスク","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 5. 延長\n\n`MiniMaxH3LatentExtend` が潜在の時間軸を伸ばし、**元の部分を固定して\n末尾だけを自由にするマスク**を同時に作ります。\n\n`extra_frames` は実フレーム数。合計は H3 の **17k+5** グリッドへ\n切り上がるので、指定より少し長くなります（39 + 34 → 73）。\n\n出力の `length` を条件付けノードに必ずつないでください。\n**元クリップの長さと一致しなくなります。**\n\n### I2V との違い\n\nI2V は静止画 1 枚から動きを推測します。こちらは**元クリップの\n全潜在フレームが固定されたまま残り、サンプラーが毎ステップ\n参照します。**カメラの動き、速度、進行方向がそのまま文脈になります。\n\n### 未検証\n\nH3 は固定長で学習されています。**この作り方の継ぎ目でまともに\n振る舞う保証はありません。**うまくいっても、再現するまでは\n偶然と見なしてください。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 5. 延長\n\n`MiniMaxH3LatentExtend` が潜在の時間軸を伸ばし、**元の部分を固定して\n末尾だけを自由にするマスク**を同時に作ります。\n\n`extra_frames` は実フレーム数。合計は H3 の **17k+5** グリッドへ\n切り上がるので、指定より少し長くなります（39 + 34 → 73）。\n\n出力の `length` を条件付けノードに必ずつないでください。\n**元クリップの長さと一致しなくなります。**\n\n### I2V との違い\n\nI2V は静止画 1 枚から動きを推測します。こちらは**元クリップの\n全潜在フレームが固定されたまま残り、サンプラーが毎ステップ\n参照します。**カメラの動き、速度、進行方向がそのまま文脈になります。\n\n### 未検証\n\nH3 は固定長で学習されています。**この作り方の継ぎ目でまともに\n振る舞う保証はありません。**うまくいっても、再現するまでは\n偶然と見なしてください。"},"color":"#6b3f47","bgcolor":"#6b3f47"},{"id":90005,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[2800,64],"size":[470,210],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"6. サンプリング","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 6. サンプリング\n\n`BasicScheduler` は `denoise 1.0` のまま。マスクが範囲を決めるので、\nここを下げる必要はありません（下げてもステップ数は減りません）。\n\nシードを振っても、マスクと参照で強く拘束されるため\n結果はほぼ同じに収束します。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 6. サンプリング\n\n`BasicScheduler` は `denoise 1.0` のまま。マスクが範囲を決めるので、\nここを下げる必要はありません（下げてもステップ数は減りません）。\n\nシードを振っても、マスクと参照で強く拘束されるため\n結果はほぼ同じに収束します。"},"color":"#3f4f63","bgcolor":"#3f4f63"},{"id":90006,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[3360,64],"size":[470,195],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"7. 出力","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 7. 出力\n\n映像と音声を別々にデコードして 1 本にまとめます。\n\n出力は指定した窓の全フレームです。**端の数フレームは捨てて**、\n元の動画に差し戻してください。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 7. 出力\n\n映像と音声を別々にデコードして 1 本にまとめます。\n\n出力は指定した窓の全フレームです。**端の数フレームは捨てて**、\n元の動画に差し戻してください。"},"color":"#4a4a4a","bgcolor":"#4a4a4a"},{"id":90007,"type":"ResolutionSelector","pos":[0,1252],"size":[360,126],"flags":{},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"aspect_ratio","name":"aspect_ratio","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"aspect_ratio"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"megapixels","name":"megapixels","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"megapixels"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"multiple","name":"multiple","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"multiple"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"width","name":"width","type":"INT","slot_index":0,"links":[38]},{"localized_name":"height","name":"height","type":"INT","slot_index":1,"links":[39]}],"title":"Resolution (megapixels)","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"ResolutionSelector"},"widgets_values":["16:9 (Widescreen)",1.5,32],"widgets_values_named":{"aspect_ratio":"16:9 (Widescreen)","megapixels":1.5,"multiple":32}},{"id":90008,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,1402],"size":[360,230],"flags":{},"order":14,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"解像度","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 解像度\n\n`megapixels` で指定します。**1.5 MP、16:9、multiple 32** が\nこのプロジェクトの全実行で使った設定です（1664 x 928）。\n\n**解像度を変えるとサンプルそのものが変わります。**同じシードでも\n同じ絵にはなりません。安く試してから本番、という使い方はできません。\n\n**書き換え対象の潜在と解像度を合わせてください。**元のクリップが\n1.5 MP なら 1.5 MP のまま。違う値にすると、マスクの外まで\n作り直しになります。\n\nJapanese text は 1 MP を下回ると崩れます。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 解像度\n\n`megapixels` で指定します。**1.5 MP、16:9、multiple 32** が\nこのプロジェクトの全実行で使った設定です（1664 x 928）。\n\n**解像度を変えるとサンプルそのものが変わります。**同じシードでも\n同じ絵にはなりません。安く試してから本番、という使い方はできません。\n\n**書き換え対象の潜在と解像度を合わせてください。**元のクリップが\n1.5 MP なら 1.5 MP のまま。違う値にすると、マスクの外まで\n作り直しになります。\n\nJapanese text は 1 MP を下回ると崩れます。"},"color":"#4a4a63","bgcolor":"#4a4a63"},{"id":221,"type":"GetVideoComponents","pos":[1682.7657142857145,883.1485714285716],"size":[280,116],"flags":{},"order":19,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":26}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","slot_index":0,"links":[27]},{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","slot_index":1,"links":[29]},{"localized_name":"fps","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","slot_index":2,"links":[]},{"localized_name":"bit_depth","name":"bit_depth","type":"INT","slot_index":3,"links":[]}],"title":"GetVideoComponents","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"GetVideoComponents"}},{"id":222,"type":"VAEEncode","pos":[1680.0000000000002,1052.0628571428567],"size":[280,142],"flags":{},"order":22,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"pixels","name":"pixels","type":"IMAGE","link":27},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":28}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"LATENT","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","slot_index":0,"links":[31]}],"title":"VAEEncode","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"VAEEncode"}},{"id":223,"type":"VAEEncodeAudio","pos":[1680.0000000000002,1240.0628571428572],"size":[280,142],"flags":{},"order":23,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","link":29},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":30}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"LATENT","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","slot_index":0,"links":[32]}],"title":"VAEEncodeAudio","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"VAEEncodeAudio"}},{"id":224,"type":"MiniMaxH3PackLatent","pos":[1680.0000000000002,1428.0628571428572],"size":[280,142],"flags":{},"order":24,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video_latent","name":"video_latent","type":"LATENT","link":31},{"localized_name":"audio_latent","name":"audio_latent","type":"LATENT","link":32}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"samples","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","slot_index":0,"links":[33]}],"title":"MiniMaxH3PackLatent","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3PackLatent"}},{"id":90003,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1680,64],"size":[467.9257142857141,185.5114285714285],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"4. 元動画から潜在","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## 4. 元動画から潜在\n\n書き換えたいカットの mp4 を VAE で潜在に戻します。\nチェックポイントが残っていなくても使えるのがこの経路の利点です。\n\n映像と音声を別々にエンコードし、`MiniMaxH3PackLatent` で\nH3 の NestedTensor（[映像, 音声]）に組み立てます。\n\n**長さは必ず `length % 17 == 5`。** 85 フレームのような無効な長さを\n入れると、往復で 73 フレームに減って戻ってきます。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 4. 元動画から潜在\n\n書き換えたいカットの mp4 を VAE で潜在に戻します。\nチェックポイントが残っていなくても使えるのがこの経路の利点です。\n\n映像と音声を別々にエンコードし、`MiniMaxH3PackLatent` で\nH3 の NestedTensor（[映像, 音声]）に組み立てます。\n\n**長さは必ず `length % 17 == 5`。** 85 フレームのような無効な長さを\n入れると、往復で 73 フレームに減って戻ってきます。"},"color":"#63563f","bgcolor":"#63563f"},{"id":200,"type":"LoadVideo","pos":[1678.6171428571424,302.77142857142854],"size":[280,236.10526315789474],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"file","name":"file","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"file"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"choose file to upload","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VIDEO","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","slot_index":0,"links":[18,40]}],"title":"RefLoadVideo","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"LoadVideo"},"widgets_values":["extend_ref.mp4","image"],"widgets_values_named":{"file":"extend_ref.mp4","upload":"image"}},{"id":220,"type":"LoadVideo","pos":[1684.148571428571,595.7257142857144],"size":[280,230.15384615384616],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"file","name":"file","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"file"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"choose file to upload","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"VIDEO","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","slot_index":0,"links":[26]}],"title":"TargetLoadVideo","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.0","Node name for S&R":"LoadVideo"},"widgets_values":["r2v_cut_src.mp4","image"],"widgets_values_named":{"file":"r2v_cut_src.mp4","upload":"image"}},{"id":226,"type":"MiniMaxH3LatentExtend","pos":[2240,545],"size":[400,260],"flags":{},"order":25,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"samples","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":33},{"localized_name":"reference","name":"reference","shape":7,"type":"VIDEO","link":40},{"localized_name":"extra_frames","name":"extra_frames","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"extra_frames"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"strength","name":"strength","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"strength"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"feather_latent_frames","name":"feather_latent_frames","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"feather_latent_frames"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"reference_frames","name":"reference_frames","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"reference_frames"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"samples","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","slot_index":0,"links":[5]},{"localized_name":"length","name":"length","type":"INT","slot_index":1,"links":[17,22]},{"localized_name":"report","name":"report","type":"STRING","slot_index":2,"links":[]}],"title":"MiniMaxH3LatentExtend","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3LatentExtend"},"widgets_values":[43,1,0.5,0],"widgets_values_named":{"extra_frames":43,"strength":1,"feather_latent_frames":0.5,"reference_frames":0}}],"links":[[1,210,0,121,1,"CONDITIONING"],[2,1945,0,121,0,"MODEL"],[3,5,0,123,0,"MODEL"],[4,121,0,124,1,"GUIDER"],[5,226,0,124,4,"LATENT"],[6,120,0,124,0,"NOISE"],[7,122,0,124,2,"SAMPLER"],[8,123,0,124,3,"SIGMAS"],[9,124,0,130,0,"LATENT"],[10,3,0,130,1,"VAE"],[11,124,0,131,0,"LATENT"],[12,4,0,131,1,"VAE"],[13,131,0,132,1,"AUDIO"],[14,130,0,132,0,"IMAGE"],[15,5,0,1945,0,"MODEL"],[16,1,0,5,0,"MODEL"],[17,226,1,201,3,"INT"],[18,200,0,201,0,"VIDEO"],[19,2,0,210,0,"CLIP"],[20,3,0,210,1,"VAE"],[21,4,0,210,2,"VAE"],[22,226,1,210,13,"INT"],[23,202,0,210,3,"IMAGE"],[24,201,0,210,5,"IMAGE"